# Tests — the Valkey thread-store suite (`npm run test:integration:valkey`).
#
# A disposable Valkey of its own, never one a server uses: the suite flushes it,
# changes its memory limit and eviction policy, and restarts its container.
# Start it with:
#
#   docker run -d --rm --name ontoforge-hs-valkey-test -p 26399:6379 valkey/valkey:8.1-alpine \
#     valkey-server --save "" --appendonly no --maxmemory 64mb --maxmemory-policy noeviction
#
# The suite needs no database and no provider.

THREAD_STORE=valkey
VALKEY_URL=redis://localhost:26399
